  "The Executive Board is responsible for providing the overall governance and leadership of the organization. The Executive Board is comprised of the President, the Vice-President of Standards, the Vice President of Member Outreach, the Treasurer and the Secretary, the Immediate Past President, and the Executive Director."=> "집행위원회는 본 조직의 총체적인 관리와 지도를 제공하는 것을 책임진다.집행위원회는 총재, 표준부 부회장, 회원확대부 부회장, 재무주관과 비서, 전임 총재와 집행이사로 구성된다." ,
